1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,800
The last train leaves at midnight.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:03,600
Run!

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
We have thirty seconds to reach it.

4
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:11,500
I thought you said the station was around the corner, not across the city.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Take the stairs.
Keep to the left.
I'll meet you there.

6
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:23,500
Wait here.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
I can hear the train.

8
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,000
Then we still have a chance.

9
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:32,000
There is the platform.

10
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,000
<i></i>

11
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:37,000
The clock has stopped.

12
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,000
<i>Meet me by the ticket office.</i>

13
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:46,000
<b>Keep the ticket.</b>

14
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:49,000
It is our way home.

15
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,000
When the doors open, let everyone get off before we try to squeeze inside.

16
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Ticket, ticket, TICKET; tickets.

17
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:03,500
<i>tick</i>et inspectors are on board.

18
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Straße, café, مرحبًا، and 中文.
